 securities, including mortgage-backed securities and corporate bonds, and deposit funds in other financial institutions. Further, the company provides automated teller machines and debit cards; telephone, internet, and mobile banking services; and ACH and wire transfers, cash management, positive pay, and remote deposit capture services. It operates in Richmond and Kings counties in New York; and Hunterdon, Mercer, Union, and Middlesex counties in New Jersey. Northfield Bancorp, Inc. was founded in 1887 and is headquartered in Woodbridge, New Jersey."}}